Exodus Privacy tracker database  (backend/src/sast/trackerData.ts)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
The list of tracker names and code signatures in backend/src/sast/trackerData.ts
is generated from the Exodus Privacy tracker database, https://exodus-privacy.eu.org
(https://reports.exodus-privacy.eu.org/api/trackers).

  The database is made available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0,
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/, and its individual contents
  under the Database Contents License (DbCL) 1.0.

That file is a derived database and stays under the ODbL, whatever licence the
rest of the project carries. Reports that list trackers say where the signatures
come from. The unmodified data is available from the address above.

